        },
        {
          "text": "\"Kubanga bw'ati bw'ayogera",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.14.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.14.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda nti, Kiriba kitya bwe ndiweereza ebibonerezo byange ebina: ekitala n'ekyeya n'ensolo enkambwe ez'omu nsiko ne kawumpuli, ku Yerusaalemi, okutta abantu baamu n'ensolo zaabwe!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye ate nga walibaawo abamu abaliwona, abaana aboobulenzi n'aboobuwala abaliggibwamu. Balijja gy'oli, era bw'oliraba enneeyisa yaabwe n'ebikolwa byabwe, olikkiriza akabi ke ndeese ku Yerusaalemi, buli kabi ke mmuleeseeko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bw'oliraba enneeyisa yaabwe n'ebikolwa byabwe olikkiriza nga sirina kye nkoze mu Yerusaalemi awatali nsonga, bw'ayogera",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
